Afterglow modifications
=======================

This is an independent Afterglow adaptation, not an official Morphe release.
Native hooks, settings ownership, and supported behavior have been adapted for
Afterglow and YouTube 21.43.523. Source origins and changes are recorded in the
relevant source headers and docs/long-press-tools.md and docs/morphe-fallbacks.md.

The bundled feature catalog also incorporates Morphe patches 2.0.0, commit
6cb8e6b6ee425eda8a854e026507286359f38a32, and patches-library 2.1.0-dev.2,
commit 42edb9710c2b63416e8eddd8096bb6a0adff75dd. Original feature implementations
are retained. Afterglow changes their public selection wrappers and connects
their settings to the Afterglow settings screen. Original source and notices,
the import recipe, and a complete feature mapping are supplied in vendor/morphe,
tools/import_morphe.py, tools/morphe-catalog.json and docs/morphe-catalog.md.
This remains an independent Afterglow distribution, not an official Morphe build.
